</div>

<div class="prose">
    <p>DataTable enterprise deklaratif persis seperti <code>&lt;p-table&gt;</code> di PrimeNG dengan pencarian data live (*client-side search*), sorting kolom klik header, dan paginasi otomatis.</p>

    <div class="component-card">
    <div class="component-header">
        <span class="component-title">Enterprise DataTable Deklaratif dengan Paginator & Live Search</span>
        <button type="button" class="btn-copy-code"><l-icon name="copy" size="13"></l-icon> <span>Salin</span></button>
    </div>
    <div class="component-canvas component-canvas-stacked">
        <div style="width: 100%;">
    <script>
        Rikat.state.usersDemo = [
            { id: "#001", nama: "Ilham Hatta Manggala", peran: "Super Admin", status: "Aktif", lokasi: "Purwokerto" },
            { id: "#002", nama: "Bambang Susanto", peran: "Senior Engineer", status: "Aktif", lokasi: "Banyumas" },
            { id: "#003", nama: "Slamet Riyadi", peran: "DevOps Specialist", status: "Review", lokasi: "Cilacap" },
            { id: "#004", nama: "Dewi Sartika", peran: "UI/UX Designer", status: "Aktif", lokasi: "Purbalingga" },
            { id: "#005", nama: "Eko Prasetyo", peran: "Frontend Lead", status: "Nonaktif", lokasi: "Kebumen" },
            { id: "#006", nama: "Fitri Handayani", peran: "Product Manager", status: "Aktif", lokasi: "Semarang" },
            { id: "#007", nama: "Guruh Sukarno", peran: "QA Engineer", status: "Review", lokasi: "Solo" }
        ];
    </script>
    <l-table [data]="usersDemo" paginator rows="4"></l-table>
</div>
